                                "sense_id": "b3f7636c-bfcd-38c6-96f0-c1721a016807",
                                "text": "Organisés par la Turquie, les premiers pourparlers directs, qui se sont tenus dans la station balnéaire d’Antalya, jeudi 10 mars, entre les ministres russe et ukrainien des affaires étrangères, Sergueï Lavrov et Dmytro Kuleba, ont échoué.",
                                "translation": "Organized by Turkey, the first direct talks, which took place in the seaside resort of Antalya on Thursday 10 March, between the Russian and Ukrainian ministers of foreign affairs, Sergey Lavrov and Dmytro Kuleba, ended in failure.",
                                "english": "Organized by Turkey, the first direct talks, which took place in the seaside resort of Antalya on Thursday 10 March, between the Russian and Ukrainian ministers of foreign affairs, Sergey Lavrov and Dmytro Kuleba, ended in failure."
